  <description>
    <p>Find duplicate files by their contents, not just their names, and free up disk space.</p>
    <p>A fast three-stage scan groups exact copies; choose which to keep and move the rest to the trash. Nothing is deleted until you confirm.</p>
    <p>Free to use; a one-time PRO licence (Gumroad) unlocks batch and advanced features. Files are processed locally.</p>
  </description>
